// P3E.3 (TD6.6, PS2.11): the Measure tool on the 100 × 10 × 10 mm beam (`simulation-beam`,
// along X from the origin), every step through the UI:
// 01 the top face selected: the bottom-right readout reads "Area: 1000.000 mm²".
// 02 the top face and the end face at x = 100: "Distance: 0.000 mm   Angle: 90.000°".
// 03 the top face and the bottom front edge: "Distance: 10.000 mm", the distance line drawn.
// 04 the Measure tool: the Measure panel at the bottom right, Minimum, the distance 10 with
//    ΔZ 10 (the Z component drawn blue), Angle 0.
// 05 Maximum: from the top's far corner to the edge's far end, √(100² + 10² + 10²) = 100.995.
// 06 a vertex alone: its X Y Z; 07 `[` closes the panel.
// P3E.3b (A1.9): the same tool in an assembly, on the interference stand-in
// (`fixtures/interference_standin.cadrs`: two 50 × 30 × 20 Blocks, the second placed at
// (40, 10, 5)), measured in assembly coordinates:
// 08 Block <1>'s top (z = 20) and Block <2>'s top (z = 5 + 20 = 25), the Measure panel
//    (the Measure tool; back to Minimum from 05's Maximum): "Distance: 5.000 mm", ΔZ 5, Angle 0.
// 09 Block <2>'s far top corner alone: X 90, Y 40, Z 25 (its own corner
//    (50, 30, 20) moved by the instance's placement).
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Wait(30),
        Custom("simulation-beam"),
        Wait(120),
        Custom("view 40 25 50 5 5 0.12"),
        Wait(20),
        Click(xyz(50, 5, 10)),
        Wait(5),
        ExpectText("measure-summary", "Area: 1000.000 mm²"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("01-top-face-area"),
        Click(xyz(100, 5, 5)),
        Wait(5),
        ExpectText("measure-summary", "Distance: 0.000 mm"),
        ExpectText("measure-summary", "Angle: 90.000°"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("02-top-and-end-faces"),
        Click(xyz(100, 5, 5)),
        Wait(3),
        Click(xyz(50, 0, 0)),
        Wait(5),
        ExpectText("measure-summary", "Distance: 10.000 mm"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("03-face-to-edge-distance"),
        Click(ui("view-measure")),
        WaitFor("measure-dialog"),
        Wait(5),
        ExpectText("measure-distance", "10.000 mm"),
        ExpectText("measure-dz", "10.000 mm"),
        ExpectText("measure-angle", "0.000°"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("04-measure-panel-minimum"),
        Click(ui("measure-mode-1")),
        Wait(5),
        ExpectText("measure-distance", "100.995 mm"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("05-maximum"),
        Key("Space"),
        Wait(3),
        Click(xyz(100, 0, 10)),
        Wait(5),
        ExpectText("measure-x", "100.000 mm"),
        ExpectText("measure-z", "10.000 mm"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("06-vertex"),
        Key("["),
        Wait(5),
        Screenshot("07-panel-closed"),
        Custom("fixture interference_standin"),
        Wait(20),
        Click(ui("tab-interference-assembly")),
        Wait(20),
        Custom("view 30 30 80 20 5 0.2"),
        Wait(20),
        Click(xyz(10, 5, 20)),
        Wait(3),
        Click(xyz(70, 30, 25)),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("view-measure")),
        WaitFor("measure-dialog"),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("measure-mode-0")),
        Wait(5),
        ExpectText("measure-summary", "Distance: 5.000 mm"),
        ExpectText("measure-distance", "5.000 mm"),
        ExpectText("measure-angle", "0.000°"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("08-assembly-top-faces-5mm"),
        Key("Space"),
        Wait(3),
        Click(xyz(90, 40, 25)),
        Wait(5),
        ExpectText("measure-x", "90.000 mm"),
        ExpectText("measure-y", "40.000 mm"),
        ExpectText("measure-z", "25.000 mm"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("09-assembly-vertex-in-assembly-coordinates"),
    ],
)
